WEBVTT

01:00:00.874 --> 01:00:03.001
I heard you the first time.

01:00:04.210 --> 01:00:05.795
(WHIMPERS)

01:00:07.755 --> 01:00:09.424
Quite the little climber, aren't you?

01:00:10.717 --> 01:00:13.511
- How old are you, boy?
- Ten.

01:00:13.636 --> 01:00:15.221
Ten.

01:00:24.063 --> 01:00:26.399
- The things I do for love.
- (GASPS)
